OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Aafter man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a man's death, police
OL,8,Fsay.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Stonehouse High
OL,11,FStreet at 23:15 GMT on Sunday after
OL,12,Freceiving reports that a man had been
OL,13,Finjured. Gloucestershire Police said he
OL,14,Fdied at the scene and added that
OL,15,Fofficers were trying to find his next
OL,16,Fof kin.
OL,18,FThe force said a man had been arrested
OL,19,Fin connection with the incident and it
OL,20,Fwas not searching for anyone else at
OL,21,Fthis time.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
