OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Aafter man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FStonehouse High Street is closed
OL,7,Fbetween Horse Trough roundabout and the
OL,8,Frailway bridge and a number of GP
OL,9,Fsurgeries, shops and pubs are shut
OL,10,Fbehind a police cordon.
